  "text": "Oncology Expansion Updates - Veterinary Medicine at Illinois\nSkip to content\nUNIVERSITY OF ILLINOIS URBANA-CHAMPAIGN\nCollege of Veterinary Medicine\nOncology Expansion Updates\nCollege of Veterinary Medicine\nOncology Expansion Updates\nIn September 2024, we started building a state-of-the-art Animal Cancer Care Clinic, made possible by a generous donor gift and a monetary match by the University. This expansion project includes a comfortable lobby for pet owners, quiet patient areas, and expanded educational spaces.\nKeep an Eye on Our Progress!\nCancer Care Stories\nSupport Our Cancer Care Clinic\nMeet Our Team\nFooter Main\nFooter Left\nCollege of Veterinary Medicine\n3505 Veterinary Medicine Basic Sciences Building\n2001 S Lincoln Ave. | Urbana, IL 61802\nFooter Left\nAdmissions:\n217-244-3648\nAcademic and Student Affairs:\n217-265-0380\nDean's Office:\n217-333-2760\nVeterinary Teaching Hospital:\n217-333-5300\nFooter Left\nFooter Middle\nQuick Links\nFooter Middle\nCalendar\nCareers\nContact\nLibrary\nPrivacy Policy\nDonate Text\nMake a donation\nCopyright\nCopyright 2026 University of Illinois College of Veterinary Medicine\nAbout Cookies",
